0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 101.39 Td (Researchers may need to integrate different sensors, actuators, or communication modules to investigate new) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 89.89 Td (research problems. A modular platform allows these components to be added or replaced without redesigning the) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 78.39 Td (entire robot.) Tj ET
