BT /F2 8.90 Tf 55.00 643.39 Td (Use Case Scenario: Consistent Motor Performance) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 631.39 Td (During prolonged swarm experiments, dedicated voltage regulation helps maintain consistent motor response) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 619.89 Td (across the fleet. Proper power regulation also prevents controller resets caused by voltage fluctuations during) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 608.39 Td (sudden motor load changes.) Tj ET
0.880 0.950 0.990 rg
1.00 w
