0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 464.39 Td (When deploying multiple robots simultaneously, individual battery protection systems help prevent overdischarge,) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 452.89 Td (excessive current draw, and unsafe operating temperatures during extended field experiments.) Tj ET
