BT /F2 8.90 Tf 55.00 296.89 Td (Use Case Scenario: Rapid Battery Replacement) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 284.89 Td (During prolonged multi-agent experiments, robots with depleted batteries can be quickly returned to operation by) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 273.39 Td (replacing their power modules with fully charged units. This allows experiments to continue with minimal) Tj ET
0.180 0.240 0.330 rg
BT /F1 8.90 Tf 55.00 261.89 Td (interruption while depleted batteries are recharged separately.) Tj ET
0.880 0.950 0.990 rg
