0.180 0.230 0.300 rg
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 44.00 682.39 Td (electronic subsystems to prevent unexpected system behavior or data loss. An additional consideration is the) Tj ET
0.180 0.230 0.300 rg
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 44.00 670.39 Td (implementation of an emergency power-disconnection mechanism that allows operators to quickly isolate the power) Tj ET
0.180 0.230 0.300 rg
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 44.00 658.39 Td (supply when necessary.) Tj ET
